{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055562540449915","content":"it comes out as","created_at":"2020-08-02T18:32:21.665000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739551180656476251","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055562540449915","content":"Something is afoot in Roanoke…\n    Earlier yesterday 2 bodies were found by Rockman, who proceeded to grab Vee and I. Upon reaching the bodies we discovered they had been dead for roughly a week, from the state of the larvae and maggots surrounding the body, they also appeared to have been scavenged thoroughly and we discovered they were Chinnokin. We left the bodies there to go give our respect to the recently married Cato and Arctura… after the party we headed back and discovered burrows around the bodies that led into town square. Upon reaching the end of the trail we discovered a jackalope named “Tristam” who informed us of a war between the Uru and the Chinnokin, as well as the culture of Uru and their rites. The Uru have used the bodies of everyone it seems to perform rituals and rites with the bodies for some kind of power. Now that leaves us with 2 possibilities in my mind, either A. The Uru killed the Chinnokin in order to perform their rite… Or B. Some outside party is attempting to pit the two races against each other by disguising murders as Uru rituals. I can’t fully rule out either option at the moment seeing as the bodies didn’t have enough evidence on or around them to say, however my friend Baeshra noted that the ritual was not fully complete yet and the bodies had not been fully used. We are not done with this case by a long shot but luckily Web was able to preserve the bodies and hold them away in their house… whatever I end up discovering I am anticipating its gonna be one long ass week… \n\nCastor Pierce","created_at":"2020-08-02T18:32:24.694000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739551193361285150","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
